Subject: [PATCH 4/6] chat: the document door: a text is read into the fold
 paragraph by paragraph, never routed

turn() sent paragraphs holding a quoted question to answering (3 of 8 read in the test text, 9 of the
first 14 of pg1342 ch. I); say() reads quotations fine (27 of 27). ingestDocument calls say() directly and
reports every paragraph it sets aside with its reason. 6 tests, with a control that fails if turn() is fixed.
Against the canonical read on 88 lines: 13 of 14 cast names, 66 of 71 verb clauses. Not wired into server.mjs.

